{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10009_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a9ccb675c531f47db4c9adbf4afd6148c60f75efc998167350f55c3cee338648",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38040434ab6fa83997d286865250c6d1c9374b1c04a0228b1aa745b2e0010295",
      "text": "男生宿舍·单间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5481f4a4a6e825068ec379e91e27d02730170fcc77fdf32cb88e93d11e2b2a1",
      "text": "那么，开始今天的练习总结会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d8e4539e550ac84e0ba71b230fc6fed5818429cfbf07c24ff436eac3ca955eb",
      "text": "老师写的练习笔记该派上用场啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e7ecc9f3d00b559f1c237fe4e078d2042766a6fc8e11809163eb612418cf496",
      "text": "……在那之后我又补充了一些地方。\n要是有不足之处就告诉我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e71bc4611b05bc19b77a08e187c5f1555e79060c4899c572913f376f97234453",
      "text": "好的！非常感谢！\n首先从各自在意的地方开始吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ca2b61d1f074f3669c45775fec1b5883cff6c08ef7fb9a802fb8b5529c23306",
      "text": "……能从我先开始吗。是关于最后\n歌舞过了一遍的时候……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae0e81995f9bf714bdd0765e7680132536125917ec4aaca5cfd101390725f865",
      "text": "（咦？没人应门……是去大吾先生或者一希先生的\n房间了吗？门没锁呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3fda619f67fb87b542f790fc47ada8eb534b7a17fe65bb05e597ee68f3647d0",
      "text": "凉先生，在吗？我开门咯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a848491496effd0545758b079d8fd25a72bdc7fd2dbff9673b3f2dcfdb8ef8bb",
      "text": "……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36585b7b8d278648ea0818bc8303aedfc905056a52a622eaab7d0e68d77db6d1",
      "text": "（大吾先生和一希先生也在。……大家都围着\n笔记睡着了。应该是聊着聊着就困了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7d8539c35490372be624078070a652eb0af7a615dd38279436de20325873518",
      "text": "（为了不着凉，帮他们盖上被子……好了。\n大家，今天辛苦了。晚安）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
